# php85-fpm named split: the FPM SAPI binary, its default command name,
# pool configuration, init units (both formats, never enabled at install),
# logrotate fragment and log directory. The php-fpm:103 identity fragment
# AND the fhs migration fragment both stay in main: the publish gate
# refuses cross-package identity moves, and fhs non-root owners must
# resolve in the same output's accounts.d. The fpm split auto-pins main,
# so identity + layout converge wherever the daemon runs. Shared
# extensions, php.ini and conf.d stay in main too.
usr/sbin/php-fpm85
usr/sbin/php-fpm
etc/php85/php-fpm.conf
etc/php85/php-fpm.d
etc/init.d/php-fpm85
usr/lib/systemd/system/php-fpm85.service
etc/logrotate.d/php-fpm
var/log/php85
